          "type": "payoff",
          "text": "✅ I have SEEN that movie three times.",
          "voice_line": "Say it right: I have SEEN that movie three times. SEEN is the past participle. It pairs with HAVE. Have seen. Has seen. Had seen. Always SEEN with a helper.",
