          "text": "The partner rule: SAW alone. SEEN + HAVE.",
          "voice_line": "Here is the partner rule. SAW is a solo traveller. I saw it last night. SEEN is a partner — it needs HAVE or HAS or HAD beside it always. Have you SEEN it? She has never SEEN snow. I had SEEN it before.",
