          "type": "explanation",
          "text": "COUNTABLE: can be counted. Has a plural.",
          "voice_line": "Countable nouns can be counted. One apple. Two apples. Three books. One question. Ten mistakes. They have a plural. You can use a or an with them. A book. An apple.",
