          "text": "UNCOUNTABLE: cannot count it. No plural.",
          "voice_line": "Uncountable nouns cannot be counted as individual items. Water. Music. Love. Advice. Information. Happiness. You cannot say one water or two musics. No plural. No a or an. Use some or any.",
